MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzY5Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/397693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc","html_url":"https://github.com/gmthedoc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T12:55:15Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T12:55:15Z","body":"Hi,\nI tested running the Godot editor both with and without VoiceMeeter open, and strangely, the section where execution time increases is display, not audio. I hope this observation can help identify the issue.\n\nI've attached the two output files for your reference.\n\nThanks!\n\n[benchmark-with.json](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18477615/benchmark-with.json)\n[benchmark-without.json](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18477614/benchmark-without.json)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602358200/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602475486","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101756#issuecomment-2602475486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101756","id":2602475486,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bHp_e","user":{"login":"gmthedoc","id":397693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzY5Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/397693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc","html_url":"https://github.com/gmthedoc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmthedoc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T13:48:38Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T13:49:26Z","body":"Using Process Monitor, I pinpointed where Godot's loading process was getting stuck: it was during the opening of the device HID\\VID_1395&PID_0024&MI_03\\A&1437F69&0&0000. With UsbDevView, I found out this device was the HID interface of a USB headset.\n\nAfter some testing, I discovered that:\n- Disconnecting the USB headset allowed Godot to work fine, even with VoiceMeeter active.\n- Reconnecting the headset to another USB port caused the issue to reappear.\n- I eventually resolved the problem by changing the headset's bitrate from 48kHz to 44.1kHz in the Windows audio settings.\n\nNow, Godot starts up as expected, even with the headset connected and VoiceMeeter active.\n\nHowever, the connection between the headset’s bitrate, VoiceMeeter and Godot’s loading process remains unclear. I hope this information helps in identifying and addressing any related issues.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602475486/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602496215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101756#issuecomment-2602496215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101756","id":2602496215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bHvDX","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T13:57:50Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T13:57:50Z","body":"Thanks for the report! Consolidating in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/20566, as this is due to the same cause.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2602496215/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]